    search:['搜索数据库、用途或字段','Search resources, uses or fields','Rechercher une ressource, un usage ou un champ','Buscar recursos, usos o campos','Bilatu baliabideak, erabilerak edo eremuak'],
    searchExample:['SGD、GO、TF、证据…','SGD, GO, TF, evidence…','SGD, GO, TF, preuves…','SGD, GO, TF, evidencia…','SGD, GO, TF, ebidentzia…'],
